  "details": "It would be incredibly time-saving if we could designate packages to install by default for specific project types, as there's some that are always going to be useful for avatars (eg; Gesture Manager or VRCFury) and Worlds (World Toolkit) and it's annoying have to apply them individually to a new project each time.\n\nHow this would work is ideally we could make a package list for each project type (Avatar 2022, World 2022, etc), and just have that pulled into the project as VCC does the initial project build.",
